   - **WeatherRisk:** High severity due to reduced visibility and braking efficiency in fog.

4. **Severity Scores:**
   - OcclusionRisk (0.92) and WeatherRisk (0.88) are both critical due to the dense fog conditions. The scores reflect the immediate danger to autonomous driving systems in such environments. Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
